# Prism environment variables (optional)

Copy values into a local `.env` if you need overrides. Do not commit real secrets.

```text
PRISM_GEN_MODEL=qwen2.5:7b-instruct
PRISM_EMBED_MODEL=nomic-embed-text
PRISM_TITLE_MODEL=qwen2.5:3b-instruct
OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434
```

Frontend (Vite):

```text
VITE_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8000
```
